  "procedure": "Window the complex azimuth row with a Tukey taper, transform it, and use the processed PFA polar angle mapping at center range frequency. Fit an intercept, linear drift, sine and cosine to unwrapped phase at each candidate frequency. Correct for two-way phase and compare the highest-variance tone with the published line-of-sight measurement.",
